{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51708","headline":"题九头鸟 · 杨义方","name":"题九头鸟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三百禽中尔最灵，就中恶尔九头名。\n数年云外藏凶影，此夜天边发差声。\n好惜羽毛还鬼窟，莫留灾害与苍生。\n况当社稷延洪日，不合鸣时莫乱鸣。\n（《监诫录》六《怪鸟应》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨义方","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51708.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51708","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}